# Pipeline source art: archives, .blend/.fbx source files, and raw effect
# packs under art/. These are inputs to the asset pipeline, not build inputs
# -- the meshes and textures the game actually loads are committed, extracted,
# under assets/. 110 MB of these archives once lived in history and made a
# fresh clone ~800 MB; keep all of art/ out. The README's preview clip and
# logo media live under docs/media/ instead, outside this rule, and stay
# committed.
art/
docs/superpowers/

